{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mysteries of Mhystaria</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mhystaria, the wandering island that appears every so often, shrouded in mist and mystery, hides along its shores the ruins of a forgotten civilization. Within its interior, strange phenomena abound\u2014phenomena no one has ever been able to explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naturally, explorers cannot resist the call of adventure. The conflict to claim its secrets before it vanishes once more is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a retro 2.5D world in Mode 7 style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself by crafting tools and upgrades at workstations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse biomes full of ruins, dangers, and unexplainable phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build your own shelter to ensure successful expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Guild and Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions for the Explorers\u2019 Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If solo adventure isn\u2019t your thing, join your friends online (up to 4 players) to explore, collaborate, or compete for the most valuable discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/extras/b3445e1f338acafb132856304915c859.avif?t=1763727713\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 If you like the project, you can support it by adding it to your wishlist. Thank you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788870?t=1763727713","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788870?t=1763727713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/940b8e2aa3b2de327e3203e59389d3de514be35b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763727713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/940b8e2aa3b2de327e3203e59389d3de514be35b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763727713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mysteries of Mhystaria</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mhystaria, the wandering island that appears every so often, shrouded in mist and mystery, hides along its shores the ruins of a forgotten civilization. Within its interior, strange phenomena abound\u2014phenomena no one has ever been able to explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naturally, explorers cannot resist the call of adventure. The conflict to claim its secrets before it vanishes once more is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a retro 2.5D world in Mode 7 style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself by crafting tools and upgrades at workstations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse biomes full of ruins, dangers, and unexplainable phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and build your own shelter to ensure successful expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Guild and Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions for the Explorers\u2019 Guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If solo adventure isn\u2019t your thing, join your friends online (up to 4 players) to explore, collaborate, or compete for the most valuable discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/extras/b3445e1f338acafb132856304915c859.avif?t=1763727713\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 If you like the project, you can support it by adding it to your wishlist. Thank you!</p>","developers":["Nowysoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/4b1e4ae8124684a58f5172d48006c4fe544c2889/header.jpg?t=1763727713","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo o equivalente<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics o superior<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3788870/1599812874/47f5f20ba4c63202e370e8c9d1f2dd81b4771197/1750376584/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748951288","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3788870/1599812874/47f5f20ba4c63202e370e8c9d1f2dd81b4771197/1750376584/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748951288","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3788870/1599812874/47f5f20ba4c63202e370e8c9d1f2dd81b4771197/1750376584/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748951288","id":257148964,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148964/f3f3df63342aa187644ecfeed66491e0f127ca6c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748951288"}],"name":"Mhystaria","package_groups":[],"pc_r